#{{context|philosophy|logic}} A [[logical]] [[fallacy]] in which a [[premise]] of an [[argument]] contains a direct or indirect [[assumption]] that the [[conclusion]] is true; [[propound]]ing a [[circular argument]]; [[circular reasoning]].
